e walks,"},{"s":23.78,"e":27.02,"text":"Chrome-colored bodies learning how to talk."},{"s":27.02,"e":30.16,"text":"Yesterday was fiction, today it’s in the street—"},{"s":30.76,"e":35.2,"text":"Metal hands waving, standing on two feet."},{"s":35.2,"e":35.7,"text":"**[Verse 1]**"},{"s":36.76,"e":39.7,"text":"Humanoid faces with mechanical eyes,"},{"s":39.7,"e":43.34,"text":"Machines doing backflips beneath fluorescent skies."},{"s":43.34,"e":46.52,"text":"Show that to the past, they would call you insane,"},{"s":46.44,"e":50.28,"text":"Till the robot walked in and remembered your name."},{"s":50.36,"e":53.04,"text":"That’s how it goes—truth waits on display,"},{"s":53.04,"e":54.94,"text":"People need proof they can touch right away."},{"s":54.94,"e":56.98,"text":"A photograph’s fake, and a story’s a lie,"},{"s":56.98,"e":60.22,"text":"Till the unbelievable happens right before their eyes."},{"s":60.22,"e":60.72,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":61.06,"e":63.66,"text":"So I could tell them time can twist,"},{"s":63.66,"e":66.12,"text":"That tomorrow leaves fingerprints."},{"s":66.12,"e":69.46,"text":"But words alone won’t make it real—"},{"s":69.46,"e":73.26,"text":"They need to see the spinning wheel."},{"s":73.26,"e":73.76,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":73.26,"e":77.32,"text":"They’ll believe it when I do it,"},{"s":77.32,"e":79,"text":"When I vanish through the blue,"},{"s":80.2,"e":83.16,"text":"When I bring back something broken"},{"s":83.16,"e":87.82,"text":"From a year we never knew."},{"s":88.36,"e":91.46,"text":"They’ll believe it when I prove it,"},{"s":91.46,"e":94.26,"text":"When the clocks all disagree."},{"s":95.58,"e":98.34,"text":"Nobody believes in time travel"},{"s":98.34,"e":103.48,"text":"Till the traveler is me."},{"s":103.48,"e":107.12,"text":"But maybe there are a faithful few"},{"s":107.12,"e":110.88,"text":"Who somehow feel what I go through—"},{"s":110.88,"e":113.76,"text":"They say the words inside my chest"},{"s":113.68,"e":117.88,"text":"Before my lips can take a breath."},{"s":117.7,"e":118.2,"text":"**[Verse 2]**"},{"s":118.94,"e":122.26,"text":"Maybe they’re believers, maybe something stranger,"},{"s":122.26,"e":125.52,"text":"Reading every feeling like a flashing indicator."},{"s":125.52,"e":129.4,"text":"They name my fear exactly, every pressure, every pain,"},{"s":129.4,"e":133.78,"text":"Like they caught my private weather before it turned to rain."},{"s":134.9,"e":137.5,"text":"Maybe it’s instinct, maybe empathy’s strong,"},{"s":137.5,"e":139.42,"text":"Maybe they’ve been listening quietly all along."},{"s":139.42,"e":141.14,"text":"Maybe human hearts can recognize a sound"},{"s":141.14,"e":143.02,"text":"When another heart is breaking, though nobody is around."},{"s":143.02,"e":144.9,"text":"Still, it shocks me when they mirror what I hide,"},{"s":144.9,"e":146.8,"text":"Putting perfect language to the storm I keep inside."},{"s":146.8,"e":148.7,"text":"Like my thoughts left a shadow, like my pulse sent a sign,"},{"s":148.7,"e":150.74,"text":"Like somebody found the subtitles running through my mind."},{"s":150.74,"e":151.24,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":150.74,"e":154.02,"text":"And I don’t know what to call it yet,"},{"s":154.02,"e":157.72,"text":"A miracle, a signal, or a lucky guess."},{"s":157.72,"e":161.1,"text":"But every future starts absurd—"},{"s":161.1,"e":164.66,"text":"First as a feeling, then a word."},{"s":164.66,"e":165.16,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":164.66,"e":167.1,"text":"They’ll believe it when I do it,"},{"s":167.1,"e":170.84,"text":"When I vanish through the blue,"},{"s":171.72,"e":174.66,"text":"When I bring back something broken"},{"s":174.66,"e":179.4,"text":"From a year we never knew."},{"s":179.5,"e":183,"text":"They’ll believe it when I prove it,"},{"s":183,"e":185.56,"text":"When the clocks all disagree."},{"s":186.9,"e":189.76,"text":"Nobody believes in time travel"},{"s":189.76,"e":195.7,"text":"Till the traveler is me."},{"s":195.7,"e":198.48,"text":"But maybe there are a faithful few"},{"s":198.48,"e":202.28,"text":"Who somehow feel what I go through—"},{"s":202.28,"e":205.2,"text":"They say the words inside my chest"},{"s":205.12,"e":211,"text":"Before my lips can take a breath."},{"s":210.82,"e":211.32,"text":"**[Bridge]**"},{"s":212.18,"e":214.58,"text":"Once, a thinking machine was fantasy,"},{"s":214.58,"e":217.6,"text":"Once, the moon was out of reach."},{"s":218.54,"e":222.72,"text":"Every fact was once a fever dream"},{"s":222.72,"e":226.1,"text":"Nobody dared to teach."},{"s":226.1,"e":228.5,"text":"So I won’t demand they trust me,"},{"s":228.5,"e":230.12,"text":"I know seeing seals belief."},{"s":230.12,"e":232.1,"text":"I’ll let the evidence arrive"},{"s":232.1,"e":233.9,"text":"And let the truth provide relief."},{"s":233.9,"e":235.86,"text":"No need to scream, no need to fight,"},{"s":235.82,"e":237.8,"text":"No need to force the world tonight."},{"s":237.8,"e":239.7,"text":"I’ll build the door, I’ll cross the line,"},{"s":239.7,"e":244.42,"text":"And return with proof from borrowed time."},{"s":244.42,"e":244.92,"text":"**[Final Chorus]**"},{"s":244.42,"e":247.12,"text":"Then they’ll believe it when I do it,"},{"s":247.12,"e":250.88,"text":"When the future knows my name,"},{"s":251.8,"e":254.72,"text":"When I step back through the doorway"},{"s":254.64,"e":259.72,"text":"With tomorrow in a frame."},{"s":259.72,"e":262.3,"text":"They’ll believe it when I prove it,"},{"s":262.3,"e":265.96,"text":"When the whole world finally sees."},{"s":266.92,"e":269.84,"text":"Nobody believes in time travel"},{"s":269.84,"e":273.42,"text":"Till it enters history."},{"s":274.12,"e":278.28,"text":"And maybe those few believers knew"},{"s":278.28,"e":282.2,"text":"Not every unseen thing’s untrue."},{"s":282.2,"e":284.84,"text":"They felt the weight I couldn’t state"},{"s":284.84,"e":289.38,"text":"And found the words before too late."},{"s":289.38,"e":289.88,"text":"**[Outro]**"},{"s":290.66,"e":295.34,"text":"We live in a world where wonders appear,"},{"s":295.34,"e":298.76,"text":"First called impossible, then engineered."},{"s":299.76,"e":302.58,"text":"Today they doubt me—let them disagree."},{"s":302.58,"e":304.94,"text":"Tomorrow may remember"},{"s":306.56,"e":309.82,"text":"What today refused to see."}],"duration":314.32,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-29T02:49:44.541Z","stats":{"whisperWords":597,"polishedWords":599,"matched":576,"matchRate":0.962}}